  {
    "title": "Decklink Duo 2",
    "description": "With four separate 3G-SDI connections\r\nSupports formats in SD and HD up to 1080p60\r\nSDI video inputs: 4 bidirectional 12-bit SD/HD connectors independently configurable as inputs or outputs\r\nSDI video outputs: 4 bidirectional 12-bit SD/HD ports independently configurable as input or output\r\nSDI audio inputs: 16 channels embedded in SD and HD\r\nSDI audio outputs: 16 channels embedded in SD and HD\r\nSync input: Tri-Sync or Black Burst\r\nComputer interface: PCI Express with 4 lanes Generation 2\r\nCompatible with 4-, 8- and 16-lane PCI Express slots\r\nSupported codecs: AVC-Intra, AVCHD, Canon XF MPEG2, Digital SLR, DV-NTSC, DV-PAL, DVCPRO50, DVCPROHD, DPX, HDV, HEVC, XDCAM EX, XDCAM HD, XDCAM HD422, DNxHR & DNxHD, Apple ProRes 4444, Apple ProRes, 422 HQ, Apple ProRes 422, Apple ProRes LT, Apple ProRes 422 Proxy, uncompressed 8-bit 4: 2:2, uncompressed 10 bit 4:2:2, uncompressed 10 bit 4:4:4\r\nIncluded software: Media Express, Disk Speed Test, LiveKey, Blackmagic Desktop Video Utility and Blackmagic drivers for Mac OS and Windows. - Media Express, Blackmagic Desktop Video Utility and Blackmagic drivers on Linux.\r\nSupported software applications: DaVinci Resolve, Fusion, Final Cut Pro X, Adobe Premiere Pro CC, Adobe After Effects CC, Adobe Photoshop CC, Avid Media Composer, Avid Pro Tools, Steinberg Cubase, Steinberg Nuendo and many more.\r\nSD video standards: 525i/59.94 NTSC, 625i/50 PAL\r\nHD video standards: 720p/50, 720p/59.94, 720p/60, 1080p/23.98,\r\n1080p/24, 1080p/25, 1080p/29.97, 1080p/30, 1080p/50, 1080p/59,\r\n1080p/59.94, 1080p/60, 1080PsF/23.98, 1080PsF/24, 1080PsF/25,\r\n1080PsF/29.97, 1080PsF/30, 1080i/50, 1080i/59.94, 1080i/60\r\nSDI compliance: SMPTE 259M, SMPTE 292M, SMPTE 296M, SMPTE 372M, SMPTE 425M, ITU-R BT.656 and ITU-R BT.601\r\nSupported SDI metadata: RP 188/SMPTE 12M-2 and Closed Captioning.\r\nAudio sampling rate: Standard television sampling rate of 48 kHz and 24 bit\r\nSDI colour accuracy: 8-, 10- and 12-bit RGB 4:4:4 in all modes up to 1080p/30 and 8- and 10-bit YUV 4:2:2 in all modes\r\n12-Bit RGB 4:4:4 supported in playback mode only\r\nSDI video sampling rate: 8-, 10- and 12-bit RGB 4:4:4 in all modes\r\nUp to 1080p/30 and 8- and 10-bit YUV 4:2:2 in all modes\r\n12-bit RGB 4:4:4 is only supported in playback mode\r\nColour space: REC 601, REC 709\r\nColour space conversion: hardware-based in real time\r\nHD downconversion: high quality built-in software downconverter for playback and capture\r\nChoice of letterbox and anamorphic 16:9 output modes for downconverted SD.\r\nHD upconversion: built-in high quality software upconversion from SD to 720HD or 1080HD on input\r\nChoice of 4:3 pillarbox, 14:9 zoom and 16:9 zoom\r\nCross-conversion: built-in, high-quality software cross-conversion from 720HD to 1080HD and 1080HD to 720HD on playback\r\nReal-time effects: DaVinci Resolve, Final Cut Pro X internal effects, Adobe Premiere Pro CC Mercury Playback Engine effects, Avid Media Composer internal effects.\r\nOperating systems: Mac Mojave 10.14, Mac Catalina 10.15 or higher, Windows 8.1 and 10, both 64 bit, Linux\r\nPower consumption: 10 W",
